---
import { site } from '../data/site';
---

<section id="sobre-mi" class="border-y border-slate-200 bg-slate-50 py-16 sm:py-24 dark:border-white/10 dark:bg-white/[0.02]">
  <div class="mx-auto grid max-w-6xl items-center gap-10 px-4 sm:px-6 lg:grid-cols-[0.85fr_1.15fr]">
    <div class="reveal flex justify-center">
      <div class="relative">
        <div class="absolute -inset-4 rounded-[2.5rem] bg-gradient-to-br from-indigo-500/30 via-cyan-400/20 to-lime-300/20 blur-2xl"></div>
        <div class="relative flex h-52 w-52 items-center justify-center rounded-[2rem] border border-slate-200 bg-gradient-to-br from-slate-100 via-white to-slate-100 text-lime-600 shadow-2xl dark:border-white/15 dark:from-indigo-600 dark:via-slate-900 dark:to-slate-950 dark:text-lime-300">
          <svg class="h-20 w-20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="m16 18 6-6-6-6M8 6l-6 6 6 6"/></svg>
          <span class="absolute -bottom-3 left-1/2 flex -translate-x-1/2 items-center gap-1.5 whitespace-nowrap rounded-full border border-white/15 bg-slate-950 px-3 py-1.5 text-[11px] font-bold text-lime-300">
            <span class="pulse-dot h-1.5 w-1.5 rounded-full bg-lime-300"></span>
            Disponible
          </span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="reveal reveal-delay-1">
      <p class="text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-cyan-700 dark:text-cyan-300">Respaldo</p>
      <h2 class="font-display mt-3 text-3xl font-extrabold tracking-tight text-slate-900 dark:text-white sm:text-4xl">Hola, soy {site.nombre}</h2>
      <p class="mt-4 text-lg leading-relaxed text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-400">
        Desarrollo sistemas para organizaciones reales: municipios, institutos, clubes y colegios profesionales.
        Traduzco tu necesidad en un sistema simple que tu equipo sí quiera usar.
      </p>
      <ul class="mt-5 space-y-2.5 text-[15px] font-medium text-slate-700 dark:text-slate-300">
        <li class="flex items-center gap-2.5">
          <span class="flex h-6 w-6 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-lime-500/15 text-lime-700 dark:bg-lime-300/15 dark:text-lime-300"><svg class="h-3.5 w-3.5" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="3" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M20 6L9 17l-5-5"/></svg></span>
          Sistemas ya en producción, no promesas
        </li>
        <li class="flex items-center gap-2.5">
          <span class="flex h-6 w-6 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-lime-500/15 text-lime-700 dark:bg-lime-300/15 dark:text-lime-300"><svg class="h-3.5 w-3.5" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="3" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M20 6L9 17l-5-5"/></svg></span>
          Trato directo conmigo, sin intermediarios
        </li>
        <li class="flex items-center gap-2.5">
          <span class="flex h-6 w-6 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-lime-500/15 text-lime-700 dark:bg-lime-300/15 dark:text-lime-300"><svg class="h-3.5 w-3.5" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="3" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M20 6L9 17l-5-5"/></svg></span>
          Precio y tiempos claros desde el día 1
        </li>
      </ul>
      <p class="mt-5 rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 bg-slate-50 px-4 py-3.5 text-sm leading-relaxed text-slate-600 dark:border-white/10 dark:bg-white/[0.04] dark:text-slate-400">
        Trabajo respaldado por <strong class="text-slate-900 dark:text-white">{site.empresa}</strong>: la confianza de una persona + el respaldo de un equipo.
      </p>
      <div class="mt-5 flex flex-wrap gap-3">
        <a href="/cv.pdf" download class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 rounded-xl border border-slate-300 bg-white px-5 py-2.5 text-sm font-bold text-slate-800 transition hover:bg-slate-100 dark:border-white/15 dark:bg-white/5 dark:text-white dark:hover:bg-white/10">
          <svg class="h-4 w-4" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M21 15v4a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2v-4M7 10l5 5 5-5M12 15V3"/></svg>
          Descargar CV
        </a>
        <a href={site.linkedin} target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 rounded-xl border border-slate-300 bg-white px-5 py-2.5 text-sm font-bold text-slate-800 transition hover:bg-slate-100 dark:border-white/15 dark:bg-white/5 dark:text-white dark:hover:bg-white/10">
          LinkedIn
          <svg class="h-4 w-4" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M7 17L17 7M8 7h9v9"/></svg>
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
